msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"(...Hey, what about her? As far as being a hostess goes, she\r\n"
"might be a good fit. Let's see here...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"(She appears to be a good conversationalist, and she's\r\n"
"also pretty smart... but I don't think she's all that\r\n"
"motivated as a person. Should I give her a chance?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "(On second thought... maybe not.)"
msgstr "(Ripensandoci... Magari no.)"

msgctxt "240"
msgid "(Okay, let's see what I can come up with...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Hey there."
msgstr "Ciao."

msgctxt "264"
msgid "\"Hey there\"? What, do I know you or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Not yet. But I feel like we've met somewhere before. Maybe\r\n"
"in a dream or a past life... Perhaps fate drew us together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"You are soooo not the type to be talking like that... But\r\n"
"it is a little cute coming from a big guy like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Thank you. To be frank, I'd like to introduce you to a job\r\n"
"I feel you would excel at. Would you care to hear more?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "What are you, some kind of cabaret club recruiter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"Yes, and I think you would make a fine hostess. Have you\r\n"
"ever considered giving it a try?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Hmm... I don't know..."
msgstr "Mmm... non so."

msgctxt "348"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Oh, what the heck. Might as well give it a shot while I'm\r\n"
"still young, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Definitely. Now please, allow me to show you to our club.\r\n"
"My name is Kiryu, by the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Cool. I'm Shoko, and I'm 22. It's a pleasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Approach Her"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Hold That Thought"
msgstr ""

